<title>UK: UK Japan stocks trade quiet with Euro bourses shut.</title>
<headline>UK Japan stocks trade quiet with Euro bourses shut.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese stocks were steady with a weaker bias on Thursday in meagre activity ahead of the UK general election result and with most European financial centres closed for May Day, dealers said.</p>
<p>The Nikkei 50 eased 0.52 points to 1,554.26 by 1358 GMT.</p>
<p>&quot;It feels like we haven't opened today,&quot; said one.</p>
<p>&quot;We've seen a wee bit of profit-taking but nothing much,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
